[{"client_msg_id":"df156ca2-f13b-42a0-bc52-5fb9724cbe7f","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```type QueryType\u0026lt;T\u0026gt; = {\n  variables: undefined;\n  skip: true;\n} | {\n  variables: T;\n  skip: false;\n};```\nを作っておいてOptionsを生成する側で使っていくのがいいのかな","ts":"1634103180.344500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+tO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5be04e8a-6db6-4616-a2f3-c7678a2c7b73","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"UnionTypeで守ってあげるとましになりそう・・・","ts":"1634102946.343900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c3Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"36e17249-734e-450b-a9ee-c1e07c20572c","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"イメージこんなの\n```type QueryType = {\n  variables: undefined;\n  skip: true;\n} | {\n  variables: { id: number };\n  skip: false;\n};\n\nconst getBarOptions = (fooData: FooData | undefined): QueryType =\u0026gt; {\n  if (fooData == null) {\n    return {\n      variables: undefined,\n      skip: true,\n    };\n  } else {\n    return {\n      variables: { id: fooData.value },\n      skip: false,\n    };\n  }\n};```","ts":"1634102917.343400","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1634102931.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u5by"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2C2BB227-BDF2-4C57-ADB7-579D18C8390E","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"まぁ、適切な名前を付けたカスタムフックにすればあんまり中身見なくていいしね。","ts":"1634102697.342500","edited":{"user":"UFHQ7TNT0","ts":"1634102709.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"40HJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e1a59795-2c08-488a-8835-ed268a152ec5","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"skipの条件とかどうせ増えていきそうだし","ts":"1634102647.341500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jIfLf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66034783-ac59-4a7c-90b3-a3a2673cb4ab","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"関数に切るとかして可読性上げればいいかなって","ts":"1634102631.341100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0fRF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"E430AB1C-A397-4A1B-8905-14C23B0D135C","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"ぱっと見は意味わからんけど、この記述量なら見慣れればイディオムでいけるかギリって感じかな","ts":"1634102607.340700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VIDe3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ee2117d2-50be-4aeb-8682-1fdaa562df28","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"クライアントにApolloとurqlのどっちを使うかは検討中・・・","ts":"1634100286.339200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5s3oo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"88cfa7ed-f490-4603-aabf-24e7aade19dd","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"しっかりと守りたいならlazy使ってuseEffectあたりでfetchするのが一番かも（そこでvariable指定し忘れたら同じだけど）","ts":"1634100233.338900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3ZLv8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e6e9e0fb-4c7d-485a-b0c6-f5a34b6eb500","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"skipの条件ミスって型に守られてるのに実行時エラー吐くことは多分あるんですけど","ts":"1634100204.338200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3EbE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be51101a-b352-4e4c-95bd-6cab0d20a155","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"\u003c@UFHQ7TNT0\u003e そういえばapolloのやつ、これでいけるのではって感じになりました\n```const useFoo ({ id }: { id?: string }) =\u0026gt; {\n  const { data } = useFooQuery({ variables: id != null ? { id } : undefined, skip: id == null })\n}```","ts":"1634100176.337600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HbJ"}]}]
